      "message": "fix(cli): report busy window and exit 4 when UI link hello times out\n\nWhen a second --ui command connects while a long command is active,\nthe CamCraft window cannot complete the handshake before the 500 ms\ntimeout expires. The CLI previously reported a stale link file.\n\nThis change adds LinkError::Busy(String) with exit code 4. It\ndistinguishes handshake timeout on an active window from a stale or\nclosed link.\n\nChangelog: Report busy window and exit 4 when a second --ui call occurs during an active command.\nFixes #3865",
